          "comment": "# Comfy MiniMax H3 Max- Text to Video\n\nGenerate polished, prompt-faithful video from text using MiniMax H3 Max, producing a single finished video clip with no input files required. Ideal for rapid concept exploration, cinematic text-to-video scenes, and high-throughput creative iteration where speed and visual quality matter. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_minimax_h3_max_t2v.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
